# P0-03 field renames (docs/jellyfin/04-architecture.md §4.2). `Old New`, whole words.
# CodingKey/String enum cases are pinned to their old raw values first.
#
# Done by hand in 03_vocabulary.post.patch, not by this table:
#   MediaStream.isSelected -> isServerSelected (the word is common UI state)
#   doviPresent/doviProfile/doviLevel/doviBLCompatID -> dolbyVision: DolbyVisionInfo?
#   PlexGuid.value(for:) -> ExternalIDs; ContentKey.plex -> .native + contentAliases
# Deferred (not renames, or owned elsewhere):
#   part.key / stream.key removal, accessible/exists -> isAvailable (P0-09)
#   thumb/art/... -> ArtworkSet (P0-04)
viewOffset          resumeOffsetMs
viewCount           playCount
lastViewedAt        lastPlayedAt
leafCount           episodeCount
viewedLeafCount     watchedEpisodeCount
streamType          kind
colorTrc            colorTransfer
PlexStreamType      StreamKind
